      "writtenOn": "2020-03-16T22:09:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For both arrays, the ordering specifies the sequence which the common icelake power code will either assert or deassert the respective signals.  The boot latency will include the sum of all latencies used in this table.  I\u0027ll think about whether it makes sense to allow these signals to be asserted in parallel using deferred calls.\nThe deassert path (used when exiting S0) doesn\u0027t have any delays, but the structure is flexible to add delays if needed.",
